{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】香港首個大型成人展取消，多名日本女優表示被拒入境，主辦單位將安排退款。</p>\n<p>活動原定周五起一連三日舉行，多名日本女優及工作人員在社交平台發文稱已經抵達香港及完成辦理簽證，但被拒絕入境，需要返回日本。</p>\n<p>主辦單位宣布取消成人展，稍後公布退款安排。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T14:19:20.938084+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T13:49:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T18:56:45.230347+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T14:12:53.389062+00:00","content_hash":"1121ec09819ef6ff2a3e82eb23656455cbb7b2dab82fef861c8dfaae6f3b667a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}